f{a}+\\mathbf{b}$, find $\\lambda$."] [:db/add "d5700f14-a6e6-5fb8-9246-58b54d4f05ea" :question/worked-solution "Construct the known component $\\mathbf{b}$ from $O$, ending at $B$. Count signed horizontal and vertical grid displacements:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\overrightarrow{OB} &=1\\,(0, -5)=(0, -5). \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{BC} &=(8, 0).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](images/c8/c839ff25040105b01838169fd12e0508ba4c6c07d314616ba96d98fe185b7581.png)\n\nCompare the remaining displacement with $\\mathbf{a}$, whose grid displacement is $(4, 0)$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Horizontal scale} &=\\frac{8}{4}=2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe scale is positive, so the remaining vector has the same direction as $\\mathbf{a}$. Thus $\\overrightarrow{BC}=2\\mathbf{a}$. By the triangle law,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{c} &=\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\overrightarrow{BC} \\\\\n&=\\mathbf{b}+2\\mathbf{a} \\\\\n&=2\\mathbf{a}+\\mathbf{b}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ are not parallel, so their coefficients are unique. Matching the coefficient of $\\mathbf{a}$ gives $\\lambda=2$."] [:db/add "d5700f14-a6e6-5fb8-9246-58b54d4f05ea" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d5700f14-a6e6-5fb8-9246-58b54d4f05ea" :question/answer-fields "966e3671-c4f3-5a1e-b600-5af682e233d6"] [:db/ensure "d5700f14-a6e6-5fb8-9246-58b54d4f05ea" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096701 :knowledge-point/questions "d5700f14-a6e6-5fb8-9246-58b54d4f05ea"] [:db/add "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0" :answer/id #uuid "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0"] [:db/add "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0" :answer/value "3"] [:db/ensure "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9" :answer/id #uuid "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9"] [:db/add "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a" :answer/id #uuid "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a"] [:db/add "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a" :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}"] [:db/ensure "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3" :answer/id #uuid "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3"] [:db/add "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9" :answer/id #uuid "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9"] [:db/add "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/id #uuid "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/choices "8342b6c2-a0ae-570e-bc6f-1f003292e7a0"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/choices "2cd4263b-1207-562b-9a3c-f8a409186ad9"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/choices "ae485313-2cc2-513e-8de0-bbefd2785d8a"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/choices "f3a7f656-9e5c-56fa-854b-5f1c2e5b32f3"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :answer-field/choices "4bf0bdca-d5ee-505f-914b-2b1174639de9"] [:db/add "f6918003-e1a3-5080-ad90-a02c824b81c5" :an